  m_text: ' In this traditional Filipino folk dance performance, dancers showcase
    the elegant steps of the Jotabal or Polkabal. The male dancer, dressed in a barong
    tagalog and straw hat, and the female dancer in a baro''t saya, embody the charm
    and grace of this cultural dance. '
